The scores in this folder are adaptations of other people's work.

    Each *.score.splash file here is a transcription (notes, dynamics,
    pedalling and tempo) of a MIDI performance by Bernd Krueger,
    piano-midi.de (http://www.piano-midi.de), licensed under the
    Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Germany licence
    (CC BY-SA 3.0 DE): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/

    The original performances are distributed unmodified in
    apps/score/resources/performances (with their own licence notice).

These adaptations are licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0 DE as well. Anyone who
redistributes them keeps this notice and the credit in each file, and any
adaptation of them must also be licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0 DE.

The compositions themselves are in the public domain. The ShareAlike term binds
these data files and adaptations of them only; the code of this crate and of
the applications that read these files stays under the repository's licence
(MIT OR Apache-2.0).
